WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:10.434
(message alert)

00:00:11.493 --> 00:00:13.993
(dance music)

00:00:33.898 --> 00:00:35.815
(sigh)

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:50.592
- Hey man we're gonna grab
lunch at that noodle place,

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:51.509
wanna join?

00:00:53.132 --> 00:00:55.379
- No thanks man, I'm cool on noodles.

00:00:55.379 --> 00:00:56.296
- Oh, cool.

00:01:09.575 --> 00:01:12.075
(dance music)

00:01:26.441 --> 00:01:29.108
(message alert)

00:01:34.185 --> 00:01:36.303
(phone tone)

00:01:36.303 --> 00:01:40.088
- Hey dudes, super
excited, exclamation point.

00:01:40.088 --> 00:01:44.824
Going to be a little late,
start without me period.

00:01:44.824 --> 00:01:47.241
(phone tone)

00:01:48.803 --> 00:01:52.970
(sigh)
(accordion music)

00:01:56.369 --> 00:01:57.373
- [Waiter] Are you ready to
order or did you wanna start

00:01:57.373 --> 00:01:59.195
with a drink?

00:01:59.195 --> 00:02:01.211
- Umm, I'm fine with a water.

00:02:01.211 --> 00:02:02.452
- What? No, no, no,
not on my birthday man.

00:02:02.452 --> 00:02:03.715
He's having a beer.

00:02:03.715 --> 00:02:04.548
- No water's fine.

00:02:04.548 --> 00:02:05.838
- Dude get a beer, seriously, I got you,

00:02:05.838 --> 00:02:07.396
don't worry about it.

00:02:07.396 --> 00:02:12.169
- [Waiter] Domestic beers
are $5 for the next hour.

00:02:12.169 --> 00:02:13.935
- Alright, I'll have a beer, thanks.

00:02:13.935 --> 00:02:14.768
- My man.

00:02:16.429 --> 00:02:20.596
- [Waiter] Thanks for joining
us, have a great night.

00:02:22.892 --> 00:02:24.809
(sigh)

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:29.613
- [Danny] Don't worry about it.

00:02:33.138 --> 00:02:35.055
(sigh)

00:02:40.246 --> 00:02:41.413
- Rough night?

00:02:43.646 --> 00:02:46.720
Stop, I'm here to surprise you.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:49.706
I know you weren't really
looking forward to tonight.

00:02:49.706 --> 00:02:52.860
- It was fine, you know, same old.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.110
Not a big deal.

00:02:55.625 --> 00:02:57.415
- Okay, well, I have an idea.

00:02:57.415 --> 00:02:59.529
It's the greatest one
ever, go with me on this.

00:02:59.529 --> 00:03:03.040
We bust out a board game,
we drink a couple beers,

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.580
on me, and I just so
happened to have procured

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.300
a fabulous movie, that I
think you're gonna love,

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.383
because I found it on your DVD shelf.

00:03:12.842 --> 00:03:15.691
- I don't know, sounds a little pricey.

00:03:15.691 --> 00:03:19.001
- (giggles) stop.

00:03:19.001 --> 00:03:21.584
(upbeat music)

